UAP-AC-LR, UAP-AC-LITE, UK-Ultra, UAP-SHD, UAP-XG - November 26, 2025
UAP-AC-PRO, UWB-XG - December 1, 2025


This release applies for these models:

UAP-AC-Lite/LR/Pro/M/M-PRO/IW/UK-Ultra
UAP-HD/SHD/XG/BaseStationXG
U6-Pro/Mesh/IW/Extender/Enterprise/Enterprise-IW

Improvements

Improved AP stability.


Changes for models upgrading from 6.6.77 version:


Added Roaming Assistant support.
Improved the 5GHz auto-channel selection algorithm ensuring a less noisy channel selection.
